{
  "id": "ru-270a3709d3da.en",
  "jokeId": "ru-270a3709d3da",
  "locale": "en",
  "title": "Whose Uncle",
  "location": "gostinaya",
  "place": "street",
  "cast": [
    "muzhik",
    "ded",
    "zhena"
  ],
  "roles": {
    "muzhik": "husband",
    "ded": "old-man",
    "zhena": "wife"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "Once upon a time there lived a husband and wife, and they would have lived very happily, but a relative moved in with them: an uncle.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "This dear uncle turned out to be a real scumbag. He was always unhappy with everything: the family didn't earn enough, the food wasn't tasty, he didn't get enough attention.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "He wore everyone out with his whims. But the family was tactful and put up with it all.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "At last the old parasite died.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.4,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "And on the way back from the funeral, the husband said to his wife:",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.2,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "I have to confess, darling, if I didn't love you so much, I would have thrown that uncle of yours out long ago.",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.4,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "character": "zhena",
      "text": "What? My uncle?",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.6,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "character": "zhena",
      "text": "I was always sure he was your uncle!",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": [],
      "laugh": "big"
    }
  ],
